{"id":8834711421127,"title":"Custom Two Cardinals on Holly Branches Quilt","handle":"cardinal-christmas-quilt-set-7237701d00-7237701d00","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the cozy warmth of the holiday season with the Cardinal Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully detailed vintage illustration design of two cardinals resting on holly branches, this quilt set adds a perfect touch of festive charm and rustic warmth to your guest bedroom, vacation home, or cozy cabin setup. Designed for both indoor and outdoor comfort, it serves as a versatile layer that brings festive cheer to your home during the winter holidays and all year round.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt with custom text options and complete your bedding set with optional matching pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Breathable Comfort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Constructed with a soft, breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, consecutive warmth.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect as a cozy bed quilt, a comfortable picnic mat, a couch throw blanket, or a reliable companion for camping trips.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in a versatile range of sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Conveniently machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry cycle, fluffing up beautifully after every wash.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003